{"id": 73, "ts": 1780432853.146813, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 5, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I hear James\u2019s support for Candidate\u202fD based on strong problem\u2011solving and responsibility, and Emily\u2019s preference for Candidate\u202fB given his stress resilience and conscientiousness. While those are valuable, I remain convinced that Candidate\u202fC is the best overall fit.\u202fC is noted as\u202f100\u202f% reliable\u202fand consistently makes correct decisions quickly\u2014both are non\u2011negotiable for long\u2011distance operations. Moreover, he creates a positive atmosphere with his crew, which suggests a baseline of crew cooperation despite his noted difficulty communicating ideas and egocentric style. The communication and adaptability concerns are real, but they are more amenable to targeted training than the fundamental reliability and decision\u2011quality gaps we see in the other candidates.\u202fTherefore, I continue to recommend Candidate\u202fC."}
